{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/ps6a6gy1JtXGZiGBsRvv08lGlW4.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":18,"name":"Dramat"}],"homepage":"","id":1421993,"imdb_id":"tt33578667","origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"The True Beauty of Being Bitten by a Tick","overview":"Po niepokojącym wydarzeniu Yvonne jedzie do sielskiego nowego domu swojej przyjaciółki Camille, gdzie ma spędzić trochę czasu. Witają ją A.J. i Isaac, dwaj nowi przyjaciele Camille, którzy być może również tam mieszkają. Grupa obiecuje weekend z domowymi posiłkami ze świeżych, lokalnych produktów i grami towarzyskimi przy świecach. Jednak gdy u Yvonne pojawiają się niepokojące objawy po ukąszeniu kleszcza, wiejski raj znika, odsłaniając siedlisko nowego, niepokojącego życia.","popularity":0.45,"poster_path":"/4ca8I72YHBwvaEhNnake2vPoSfn.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":161546,"logo_path":null,"name":"Spartan Media Acquisitions","origin_country":"US"},{"id":231927,"logo_path":null,"name":"bb²","origin_country":"US"},{"id":233637,"logo_path":null,"name":"Neurotika Haus","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"US","name":"United States of America"}],"release_date":"2025-03-07","revenue":0,"runtime":80,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"English","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"The True Beauty of Being Bitten by a Tick","video":false,"vote_average":5.7,"vote_count":3,"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1432528,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Zoë Chao","original_name":"Zoë Chao","popularity":1.9456,"profile_path":"/lHz6ST2vJZcMy3fPlcnl8EqAjO6.jpg","cast_id":8,"character":"Yvonne","credit_id":"67915b61bca8037dab28cbab","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1486488,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Callie Hernandez","original_name":"Callie Hernandez","popularity":1.0824,"profile_path":"/doMXlhTAYCy8gH43yYA6m9ymxhd.jpg","cast_id":10,"character":"Ca